  message: "P3 REVIEW 2026-11-01 (dev 100b6fbb6e; owner-requested re-check of open P3 items last modified before 2026-10-20; fixtures under ~/hypergumbo_lab_notebook/p3_review_11012026/misc2/). VERDICT: OBSOLETE. 2026-11-01 review on dev 100b6fbb6e: block_hash.py is unchanged since f1250331f6, so both channels still perturb no digest. But the item's trigger (narrowing lands) fired in 1ee9984304 (WI-bolot, done, opt-in, CI-off), and narrowing keeps touching_test_files (selection_index.py:403): every test observed executing ANY block of a changed FILE, independent of digests. A shadowing def or pragma edit still keeps that file's tests. This is from a code read; no live narrow was run. MECHANISM: block digest is position/comment-independent so shadowing and pragma edits escape it; the narrowing keep set is file-level so both are covered. PROPOSED DISPOSITION: close (awaiting owner authorization; status unchanged)."  # 74c8
